708 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (Based on this analysis, the new system is designed to automate all processes, reduce errors, and improve efficiency. The system ensures better performance, security, and user satisfaction.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
709 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (The analysis focuses on different modules such as user management, product management, cart system, and payment processing. It also examines how data flows between the user interface, server, and database. The existing manual system is analyzed and its drawbacks, such as time consumption, limited accessibility, and poor data management, are identified.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
710 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (System analysis for the Online Shopping System involves studying the requirements of users and understanding how the system should function to provide an efficient shopping experience. The system is designed to allow users to register, log in, browse products, add items to the cart, and place orders online.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
