714 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 306 0 R
/E (The Online Shopping System fulfills this need by providing a digital platform where users can easily browse products, place orders, and make payments. It reduces manual work, improves accuracy, and enhances the overall shopping experience for both customers and administrators.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
715 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 306 0 R
/E (The need for the Online Shopping System arises due to the drawbacks of traditional shopping methods. In the existing system, customers must visit physical stores, which requires time and effort. There is also difficulty in maintaining records of products, customers, and sales manually.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
716 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
